      "message": "fix(build): sed_in_place stops the wasm build script when sed fails\n\nsed_in_place ran sed and the move in an && list, which bash exempts from\nset -e, so a failing sed passed silently. It now returns 1 naming the file\non a failed sed or move, and each of its three callers stops with die.\n\nFixes #1486\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
